{{Quote|The Ileenium system?''"<br />"''Yes, the Ileenium system. That's the one. Get us there as fast as you can.|[[Rey Skywalker|Rey]] and [[Finn]]|<ref name="Episode VII" />}}
The '''Ileenium system''', also known as the '''D'Qar system''',<ref name="Novel" /> was a [[star system]] located in the [[Outer Rim Territories]]. [[D'Qar]], the [[planet]] which served as the [[Resistance base|base]] of the [[Resistance]] thirty [[Standard year|years]] after the [[Battle of Endor]], was located in this system.<ref name="Episode VII" />

